## Build artifacts
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcarchive

## Xcode autogenerated
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Xcode Playground
timeline.xctimeline
playground.xcworkspace

## Project settings résolus automatiquement
*.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata.lock

